MID_SE_Set_Dai_C: <EDH>
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_001: Another day, another fail. That lady took one look at\nme and ran for the hills...
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_002: It's been a while since I left Kunlun... But nobody\nwants to date me.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_003: Why aren't any of the ladies interested in me?!\nDamn it all!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_004: Dadao, calm yourself. Look—you've left a hole in\nthe wall.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_005: Eh? Oh, yeah, there it is. Huh.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_006: Well, that's a crappy wall made by an incompetent\nperson, clearly.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_007: Always so reckless. Will you ever adjust your\ncareless nature?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_008: Me? Careless? I'm just upset, man. I got dumped, and\nI punched the wall.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_009: I understand your desire to befriend women.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_010: But if you conduct yourself as you have, it won't be\npossible. Your behavior is domineering and stubborn.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_011: To top it off, you act unpredictably and in a brash\nmanner. It doesn't make you very approachable.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_012: I'm standing here listening to you, but all I'm hearing\nis "blah, blah, blah."
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_013: If you're so good at it, why don't you show me how\nto snag a date, then.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_014: What, me? No, impossible. I have long been—
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_015: {SetColor=Gray}You know, he likely wouldn't believe that I\nhave a family...{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_016: {SetColor=Gray}Worse still, he might ask me to introduce\nhim to my daughter.{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_017: What're you muttering about? You're so weird.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_018: Weird, preachy, doesn't even know how to explain\nthings well.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_019: I do so! And besides, that's not why—
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_020: That's it. I'm done listening to you.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_C_021: How rude! I don't know how I'll ever get him\nto see the error of his ways...
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B: <EDH>
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_001: The city has been thoroughly damaged. I hope that it\nwill be rebuilt swiftly.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_002: Pardon me, sir. Didn't the west side require repairs\non the exterior wall?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_003: Nah, it's already done. Finished last night, in fact.\nOnly reconstruction work left is in the city.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_004: Is that so? Far ahead of schedule, then.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_005: Someone quite skilled must have done the work. May\nI see the assignment sheet?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_006: Let's see... The repairs were handled by...Dadao?!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_007: I am not sure I believe this. I'll need to see it myself.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_008: Damn, I finished up early, and there's still more work\ncoming in. When's it gonna end?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_009: Pfft, why fix the barn when we can just eat all the\nlivestock instead?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_010: That would be frivolous, particularly in such times as\nthese. Food is precious.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_011: Ugh, you? Look, if you're here to lecture me, I'm not\ngonna listen.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_012: I have no such intentions. I came here to inspect the\nexterior wall on the west side.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_013: I felt certain you must have cut corners in the work,\nbut in fact you did a fantastic job.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_014: Even now, I can see that you are reinforcing the\nentire foundation as well as patching the holes.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_015: Yeah, I mean, that's standard. Back in the village, I\nalways had to fix the buildings I messed up.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_016: The holes revealed interior damage, so it's easier to\nrebuild the whole thing to be more sturdy.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_017: Indeed. Your assessment is accurate. And I find it\ncommendable that you are being so diligent.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_018: Huh... You're really taking note of my work.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_019: I too like working with my hands. Seeing a job well\ndone warms my heart.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_020: Although, you act very put out by the work itself,\nwhich is a disappointing attitude.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_021: Yeah, I get annoyed when there's no end in sight.\nBut who asked you?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_022: Well, your approach to the work could yield positive\nbenefits for you.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_023: I'm sure everyone is grateful for the excellent\ncraftsmanship you are bringing.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_024: If you work with a scowl, however, I doubt any\nwomen will approach you.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_025: So if I work hard with a smile on my face, they'll\ncome flocking to me!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_026: Certainly. You are surely attractive enough for such\nan outcome.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_027: But you won't see results immediately. You must be\npersistent in your approach.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_028: Now then, I will join you at your task. I feel a sense\nof responsibility here, as well.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_B_029: Heyyy, you're actually not half bad! Alright, let's\ndo this!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A: <EDH>
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_001: Wow, I didn't know there's such an amazing building\nin your hometown!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_002: Yes, they call it Garreg Mach Monastery. It is an\nextremely important place in Fódlan.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_003: It has been built in a defensible location to ensure it\nis never destroyed.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_004: That does sound pretty darn important. Back in my\nvillage, all of our structures were super sturdy.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_005: We built them with sand hardened with sandworm\nfluids. We've done it that way forever.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_006: What a fascinating architectural technique. Talking\nwith you is truly enjoyable.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_007: Hey, I feel the same! I never get bored talking to you!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_008: Ha. I'm glad to hear it. Is...something the matter?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_009: Yeah, uh...I wanted to mention something.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_010: I kept working with a smile on my face, just like you\nsuggested. But not a single lady came my way.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_011: Oh! Is that what's on your mind? Well, you can't\nrush such things.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_012: You may not yet have results, but if you continue to\nlead in a decent and honest manner, then you'll—
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_013: I've finally figured it out, Seteth. Your approach\nwon't ever get me a date.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_014: {SetColor=Gray}Here I thought I was guiding him well, but it appears\nI have failed...{SetColor=Default}
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_015: Gah, you really have such a hard time, huh, buddy?!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_016: What are you doing?! And...why are you crying?!\nI... Unhand me!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_017: You came all the way here because you were\nstruggling in Fódlan, right?!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_018: St-struggling? Me? I... I've never—
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_019: You're always acting all superior, but here you are,\ntotally incapable of helping me get a lady.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_020: Even if I do what you said, I won't get anywhere.\nAnd neither will you.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_021: I bet you've been rejected so many times! You have\nno idea how to be likable, do ya?
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_022: Hold on, this is all a misunderstanding. I was simply\nworking to help you—I am not seeking a mate.
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_023: There's no need to pretend anymore, Seteth! I'm the\nonly one who knows your true worth!
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_024: It's all so frustrating... You've been trying so hard for\nso long! *sob*
MID_SE_Set_Dai_A_025: A river of tears, shed for me? Touching... And yet,\nmisguided in so many ways.